# redshift_role (Resource)

Manages one database role, independently of memberships and grants. See AWS
[CREATE ROLE](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_CREATE_ROLE.html).

```sql
CREATE ROLE name;
DROP ROLE name;
```

